  "segments": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "start_ms": 1320,
      "end_ms": 5000,
      "text": "有一个小朋友什么语无伦次啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "start_ms": 5000,
      "end_ms": 8360,
      "text": "说他在什么soul上面SOUL啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "start_ms": 8360,
      "end_ms": 10280,
      "text": "soul这个软件里面遇到一个人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "start_ms": 10280,
      "end_ms": 12080,
      "text": "然后开始说了一些口无遮拦"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "start_ms": 12080,
      "end_ms": 13080,
      "text": "说了一些话"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "start_ms": 13080,
      "end_ms": 15600,
      "text": "然后他妄想症发作了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "start_ms": 15600,
      "end_ms": 16549,
      "text": "你知道吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "start_ms": 16549,
      "end_ms": 20599,
      "text": "他就是说他就以为网络舆论全在讨论他的事"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "start_ms": 20599,
      "end_ms": 22609,
      "text": "没有网络舆论没在讨论他的事"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "start_ms": 22609,
      "end_ms": 23850,
      "text": "他害怕啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "start_ms": 23850,
      "end_ms": 28050,
      "text": "然后他是什么害怕牵连他的家人啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "start_ms": 28270,
      "end_ms": 32130,
      "text": "是他说这个他说他是爱国的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "start_ms": 32130,
      "end_ms": 35970,
      "text": "说那些话不过是抑郁的时候说了一些气话"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "start_ms": 37440,
      "end_ms": 39760,
      "text": "所以我现在先打包票"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "start_ms": 39760,
      "end_ms": 41020,
      "text": "就是我们国家"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "start_ms": 41020,
      "end_ms": 45490,
      "text": "如果你是因为政治性的发言而怎么怎么样的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "start_ms": 45490,
      "end_ms": 49360,
      "text": "是不会牵连你的父母的啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "start_ms": 49360,
      "end_ms": 50140,
      "text": "不会千点负"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "start_ms": 50140,
      "end_ms": 51640,
      "text": "除非你就是说冥顽不灵"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "start_ms": 51640,
      "end_ms": 52950,
      "text": "比如说举个例子啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "start_ms": 52950,
      "end_ms": 55140,
      "text": "到什么程度会牵连你的爹妈"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "start_ms": 55140,
      "end_ms": 59280,
      "text": "比如说你在国内说很多冲塔的话"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "start_ms": 59280,
      "end_ms": 60270,
      "text": "违禁的话"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "start_ms": 60270,
      "end_ms": 63890,
      "text": "然后你run到国外去"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "start_ms": 63890,
      "end_ms": 65750,
      "text": "你跑到国外去"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "start_ms": 65750,
      "end_ms": 66770,
      "text": "跑到国外去"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "start_ms": 66770,
      "end_ms": 69470,
      "text": "你还继续说这些冲塔的话"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "start_ms": 69470,
      "end_ms": 72560,
      "text": "这个时候你的家人就会过来劝你"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "start_ms": 72560,
      "end_ms": 77230,
      "text": "否则他可能他的那个就会举个例子说啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "start_ms": 77230,
      "end_ms": 79570,
      "text": "如果你不不停止说这话"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "start_ms": 79570,
      "end_ms": 81310,
      "text": "我就要被裁员了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "start_ms": 81310,
      "end_ms": 84100,
      "text": "或者说我的养老退休待遇就要受影响"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "start_ms": 84100,
      "end_ms": 85360,
      "text": "其实不会的啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "start_ms": 85360,
      "end_ms": 86440,
      "text": "其实不会的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "start_ms": 86440,
      "end_ms": 90400,
      "text": "这个东西都是一个一些这个工作人员施压"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "start_ms": 90400,
      "end_ms": 91720,
      "text": "教的一些话术"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "start_ms": 91720,
      "end_ms": 95040,
      "text": "事实上他们也没有这个权利这样做"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "start_ms": 95040,
      "end_ms": 96050,
      "text": "你知道吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "start_ms": 96050,
      "end_ms": 96830,
      "text": "明白吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "start_ms": 96830,
      "end_ms": 97730,
      "text": "但没这个办法"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "start_ms": 97730,
      "end_ms": 98330,
      "text": "没那个本事"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "start_ms": 98330,
      "end_ms": 100730,
      "text": "说养老金说跟乌发二跟账户特斯特办"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "start_ms": 100730,
      "end_ms": 102700,
      "text": "取消掉那个民政口的人不跟你拼命啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "start_ms": 102700,
      "end_ms": 105820,
      "text": "凭什么安全口的就就就可以做这种决定"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "start_ms": 105820,
      "end_ms": 108580,
      "text": "或者说嗯没那个本事了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 45,
      "start_ms": 108580,
      "end_ms": 110110,
      "text": "你知道吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 46,
      "start_ms": 110570,
      "end_ms": 112630,
      "text": "所以说这个小朋友现在在这里"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 47,
      "start_ms": 112630,
      "end_ms": 114130,
      "text": "应该是妄想症发作了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 48,
      "start_ms": 114130,
      "end_ms": 116699,
      "text": "他怎么感觉他的生活都被监控了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 49,
      "start_ms": 116699,
      "end_ms": 121049,
      "text": "在我这里给你就是说保底不可能牵连到你家人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 50,
      "start_ms": 121049,
      "end_ms": 122900,
      "text": "不会影响你爸妈"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 51,
      "start_ms": 122900,
      "end_ms": 126560,
      "text": "但是如果你做一些事情是有政治危害"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 52,
      "start_ms": 126560,
      "end_ms": 127640,
      "text": "然后最后被判刑了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 53,
      "start_ms": 127640,
      "end_ms": 129229,
      "text": "那会影响你后代"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 54,
      "start_ms": 129229,
      "end_ms": 130789,
      "text": "会影响你后代的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 55,
      "start_ms": 130789,
      "end_ms": 135020,
      "text": "这个如果要考试进体制内上班的话"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 56,
      "start_ms": 135020,
      "end_ms": 136190,
      "text": "会影响你后代"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 57,
      "start_ms": 136190,
      "end_ms": 137090,
      "text": "你的子女"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 58,
      "start_ms": 137090,
      "end_ms": 140269,
      "text": "他的那个政审通不过啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 59,
      "start_ms": 140609,
      "end_ms": 143629,
      "text": "但是反过来会不会反过来影响你爹妈"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 60,
      "start_ms": 143629,
      "end_ms": 144259,
      "text": "不会啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 61,
      "start_ms": 144259,
      "end_ms": 146149,
      "text": "不会"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 62,
      "start_ms": 147660,
      "end_ms": 149840,
      "text": "啊不会啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 63,
      "start_ms": 152280,
      "end_ms": 155480,
      "text": "这个他可能soul上面认识的这个人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 64,
      "start_ms": 155480,
      "end_ms": 159660,
      "text": "可能和他有什么纠葛纠葛"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 65,
      "start_ms": 159940,
      "end_ms": 162060,
      "text": "我叫我指条明路给他"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 66,
      "start_ms": 162060,
      "end_ms": 164030,
      "text": "我没啥明路"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 67,
      "start_ms": 164030,
      "end_ms": 166670,
      "text": "那你就好好上班过正常生活的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 68,
      "start_ms": 166670,
      "end_ms": 170880,
      "text": "就是说那个他还欠了网贷"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 69,
      "start_ms": 174220,
      "end_ms": 176580,
      "text": "他现在应该是"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 70,
      "start_ms": 179920,
      "end_ms": 182550,
      "text": "至少你爹妈不会受影响啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 71,
      "start_ms": 182550,
      "end_ms": 183660,
      "text": "所以他对你"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 72,
      "start_ms": 183660,
      "end_ms": 186509,
      "text": "如果说如果你有妄想症啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 73,
      "start_ms": 186509,
      "end_ms": 188189,
      "text": "我也没办法说服一个妄想症患者"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 74,
      "start_ms": 188189,
      "end_ms": 190589,
      "text": "说你这些东西是妄想妄想的啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 75,
      "start_ms": 190589,
      "end_ms": 191429,
      "text": "如果不是妄想症"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 76,
      "start_ms": 191429,
      "end_ms": 192689,
      "text": "确实他被那个人威胁了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 77,
      "start_ms": 192689,
      "end_ms": 193529,
      "text": "或者怎么样忽悠了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 78,
      "start_ms": 193529,
      "end_ms": 196050,
      "text": "那我只能说那个人在忽悠你"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 79,
      "start_ms": 196050,
      "end_ms": 198020,
      "text": "哈哈哈啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 80,
      "start_ms": 198020,
      "end_ms": 199100,
      "text": "那个人在忽悠你啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 81,
      "start_ms": 199100,
      "end_ms": 200330,
      "text": "那个人在忽悠你"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 82,
      "start_ms": 200330,
      "end_ms": 202760,
      "text": "你实在受不了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 83,
      "start_ms": 202760,
      "end_ms": 204209,
      "text": "请你直接报警"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 84,
      "start_ms": 204209,
      "end_ms": 205709,
      "text": "你可以直接报警啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 85,
      "start_ms": 205709,
      "end_ms": 206789,
      "text": "那个B这样忽悠你"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 86,
      "start_ms": 206789,
      "end_ms": 208970,
      "text": "你可以直接报警啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 87,
      "start_ms": 209790,
      "end_ms": 213590,
      "text": "是不会说千里的家人的这个这个底线还是有的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 88,
      "start_ms": 213590,
      "end_ms": 215460,
      "text": "这个底线还是有的"
    }
